{"unit_id":"lordqyxz__dsh-ark-quota#card-zh","repo":"lordqyxz/dsh-ark-quota","commit":"8859642adc9c0183f8f63e125af50c9c5b78011a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ark-quota 是面向 DSH Web 的火山方舟订阅额度侧边栏组件。它在宿主侧注册额度查询路由并对火山 OpenAPI 请求签名，在浏览器侧把额度卡片放进侧栏底部，并提供独立设置页。卡片显示五小时、周和月额度用量、重置时间及消耗趋势预测；还可按会话模型路由切换账号或手动固定查看路由。未订阅 Coding Plan 时会尝试读取 Agent Plan。使用者需要火山方舟订阅和 AK/SK 凭据，并可在设置页调整刷新间隔。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1188","lib/client.js:1812"]}
{"unit_id":"lordqyxz__dsh-ark-quota#card-en","repo":"lordqyxz/dsh-ark-quota","commit":"8859642adc9c0183f8f63e125af50c9c5b78011a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ark-quota adds a Volcano Ark quota widget to DSH Web. It shows five-hour, weekly, and monthly usage, reset times, and burn forecasts. The widget follows the session model route or pins another route. If Coding Plan has no quota, it checks Agent Plan. Set keys and refresh timing in settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1188","lib/client.js:1812"]}
